# Hooks are the fast path, not the only one. A pane whose hooks died —
# settings rewritten under a long-lived session — sits calm while visibly
# generating, so a spinning title promotes it to running.
# %0 idle + spinner -> running. %1 idle + idle mark -> stays idle.
# %2 holds a dialog-class red: a repaint must never bury the user's prompt.
v1	-300	agent.launch	%0	zsh
v1	-300	agent.launch	%1	zsh
v1	-300	ask.permission	%2	zsh
v1	0	tick	-	system
